      "source": "./plugins/research-team",
      "description": "Multi-agent research system for comprehensive topic investigation. The research-team:coordinator skill decomposes a topic into subtopics, spawns parallel research-specialist subagents, and delegates synthesis to a report-writer \u2014 all from the main agent thread so nested-spawn constraints don't apply. Includes Joplin integration.",
